@startuml keyboard
!include _theme.puml

title The keyboard, remapped — and speech on a held key

component "Your keyboard\n(built-in or external)" as kbd #F5F5F2
component "kanata\nhome-row mods · navigation layer · chords" as kanata #EAF3F8
component "The application\nyou are typing in" as app

kbd --> kanata : every key press
kanata --> app : remapped keys

component "voxtype\nspeech to text" as vox #E6F4F4
kanata ..> vox : hold Menu = record
vox --> app : the words you spoke,\ntyped where the cursor is

note bottom of app
  kanata sits between the keyboard and
  everything else, so the same remapping —
  and the same hold-to-talk — works in
  every application without each one
  needing to know about it.
end note
@enduml
